{'symbol': 'V', 'date': '2022-09-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'GM SECTEC AND VISA STRENGTHEN PARTNERSHIP TO DELIVER BEST-IN-CLASS CYBER SECURITY CAPABILITIES IN LATIN AMERICAN AND CARIBBEAN', 'text': 'SAN JUAN, PUERTO RICO AND MIAMI , SEPT. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GM SECTEC, THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CYBERSECURITY, AND VISA, GLOBAL LEADER IN DIGITAL PAYMENTS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE STRENGTHENING OF THEIR PARTNERSHIP TO FACILITATE FRAUD PREVENTION, CYBER DEFENSE AND CYBERSECURITY BEST PRACTICES IN THE LATIN AMERICA AND CARIBBEAN REGION.'}